+#if defined(__SWITCH__)
+  // Run 35 (stock clocks): 60-80 thousand svcSignalToAddress a second, and the audio worker woken 28 thousand times a
+  // second by signals that were not its. An event or a semaphore now calls the kernel only for the waiters it has:
+  // esperando_ counts the threads asleep in its own Wait, sondeado_ the WaitMultiple polls that look at it (only
